// template: Night Petals
// order: 2
// Emotional melodic techno: a rolling 1/16 bass under a long, singing lead; an arp that
// repeats for 8 bars and opens slowly; a long breakdown with felt piano, strings and
// choir. Every melody is original.
title "Night Petals"
tempo 122
key d minor
kick:    kick       rumble   x... x... x... x... | gain 0.9
sub:     sub        pure     d1 ~ ~ ~ / bb0 ~ ~ ~ / f1 ~ ~ ~ / c1 ~ ~ ~             | duck 0.9 | gain 1.29
bass:    bass       rolling  . d2 d2 d2 . d2 d2 d2 . d2 d2 d2 . d2 d2 d2 / . bb1 bb1 bb1 . bb1 bb1 bb1 . bb1 bb1 bb1 . bb1 bb1 bb1 / . f2 f2 f2 . f2 f2 f2 . f2 f2 f2 . f2 f2 f2 / . c2 c2 c2 . c2 c2 c2 . c2 c2 c2 . c2 e2 g2   | duck 0.85 | cutoff sine(16) 350..1100 | gain 0.7
clap:    clap       roomy    .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb wide | gain 0.55
hat:     hat        metal    . x x?0.5 x . x x?0.5 x . x x?0.5 x . x x?0.6 x     | gain 0.4 | pan -0.15
ohat:    hat        open     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 0.4 | pan 0.15
shaker:  shaker     soft     x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6 x x?0.6   | gain 0.15 | pan 0.3
perc:    perc       drop     .... ..x. .... .... / .... .... ..x. ..x.             | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan -0.35 | gain 0.45
ride:    ride       ping     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | pan 0.25 | gain 0.34
arp:     pluck      bright   Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbmaj7 ~ ~ ~ / Fmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Csus4 ~ C ~   | arp updown | arp-rate 1/16 | arp-octaves 2 | brightness saw(32) 0.2..0.85 | highpass 350 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | duck 0.5 | gain 0.5
pad:     pad        bright   Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbmaj7 ~ ~ ~ / Fmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Csus4 ~ C ~   | voicing spread | brightness sine(32) 0.25..0.65 | duck 0.6 | reverb sea | gain 0.38
strings: strings    high     Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / C ~ ~ ~                | voicing spread | reverb sea | gain 0.41
piano:   piano      felt     a4 ~ ~ . f4 ~ g4 ~ / a4 ~ c5 ~ bb4 ~ a4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ . f4 ~ e4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ ~ e4 ~ d4 ~   | delay 1/4 | reverb sea | gain 0.6
lead:    lead       glass    a4 ~ ~ . f4 ~ g4 ~ / a4 ~ c5 ~ bb4 ~ a4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ . f4 ~ e4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ ~ e4 ~ d4 ~   | legato | glide 0.08 | attack 0.08 | release 1.5 | cutoff sine(16) 1400..3800 | delay 1/4 | reverb sea | gain 0.8
answer:  harp       glass    . . . . . . d5 . / . . . . . . f5 . / . . . . . . c5 . / . . . . e5 ~ d5 .   | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan 0.3 | gain 0.35
choir:   choir      ooh      Dm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~ / F ~ ~ ~ / C ~ ~ ~                | vowel sine(16) 0.2..0.7 | reverb sea | gain 0.4
rise:    noise      white    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser      both     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
impact:  impact     deep     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.8
section intro   kick hat shaker perc pad
section groove  kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker perc arp pad | loop
section build   kick sub bass clap hat shaker perc ride arp pad rise
section break   pad strings piano choir down
section lift    arp strings choir riser
section drop    kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker perc ride arp pad lead answer impact
section groove2 kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker perc arp answer
section break2  strings piano answer choir down
section drop2   kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker perc ride arp pad strings lead answer choir impact
section outro   kick hat shaker perc arp
song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, break 32, lift 8, drop 32, groove2 16, break2 16, lift 8, drop2 32, outro 16
